{"id":"vod_md_5035","vodId":"5035","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"堀与宫村","name_cn":"堀与宫村","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"13集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230916-1/cf6431045d460813acf024a1e5e7edba.jpg"},"summary":"堀京子（户松遥 配音）是长相漂亮，穿戴又十分时尚的潮流女孩，在学校里颇有一番人气。可一回到家，为了照顾年幼的弟弟和方便做家务，京子会换上非常土气的居家服，常年不在家的母亲让京子在不知不觉中扮演了代替者的角色，但这样地味的一面，可千万不能让学校的同学们知道啊！一天，一个 耳朵上打满了耳洞的刺青男敲响了京子家的大门，穿着居家服的京子去看们，让她没有想到的是，眼前这个潮男，竟然是平日里在班上被评价为宅男的宫村伊澄（内山昂辉 配音），原来宫村和京子一样，过着隐秘的双重生活。以弟弟为契机，宫村开始频繁的拜访京子家，两人以他们的真面目相对，心与心之间的距离逐渐缩短。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-16 08:38:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/quX8CoYi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/l12cMPoD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/uKiPccx5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/WfYIaNWn/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/R3VexAEE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/Zw9FEFKf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/LA6gavFL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/1yebJctZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/HrRVUARi/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/5BHi1Gap/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/TuXuQSXF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/S1IjdbJY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/kWHNbinC/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:07.675Z"}